    {
      "q": "Which agencies buy from Ernst and Young?",
      "a": "The Department of Defense is Ernst and Young's largest buyer, providing $162M in FY2026 to date. The General Services Administration purchased $45.9M and the Department of Housing and Urban Development purchased $35.7M. Other buyers include the Department of Justice at $22.5M and the Department of Homeland Security at $10.6M."
    },
    {
      "q": "What does Ernst and Young sell to the government?",
